{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-03",
  "title": "Oatstalk, Easily Alight",
  "storyCode": "R8-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "661f55d9dc5f1be9d7fe454be1050e543a6b7cff0e9f35ad8e1a768faa6495b1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Patrol Unit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nggaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Patrol Unit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aahh... aaaaaahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah...! You... ngh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that fire your doing!? You're the one who set them alight... guh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alina, I'm sorry. This will surely mean even worse to come for the village. But I just couldn't stand it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just couldn't stand this sort of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Alina?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Facing her, Talulah was taken aback. Alina met her gaze with an expression she'd never seen her wear before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's a fire in your eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I knew from the moment you came to this village, you'd never be willing just to stay here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You came from somewhere. Where you came from, you'll go back to. This village can't hold you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I won't go back. Don't look at me like that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But within your eyes, truly, there's a fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You wanted to set something alight, burn it away, you thought none of this was how it should be, you bore it until you could bear it no more..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It shouldn't have been now, Talulah. Not now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The villagers are innocent. Your one flare of anger only served to hurt them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Patrol Unit",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened—oh, God! What the hell is going on?! Who!? Who did this!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah! Talulah! Run, now, run! And don't look back! Don't ever come back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Blessings, your Majesty, bless this girl like my daughter, bless her to live on, bless her so she can live on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah, we need to go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... those hideous patrolmen!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're Infected, but none of the villagers are!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What did you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm Infected too, Talulah. I'm Infected too."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Pant*, *pant*... This is... where we'd planned to move. We had everything ready... but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They... The old man was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can't let them do this again... we can't let them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He saved you, saved me, saved the whole village."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You threw... his whole plan into disarray."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you even mean? The villagers were the ones who—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Wait. You mean the one who turned him in... was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was his idea. That way, the Patrol wouldn't come again, and hopefully, that would've been that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter how much strength you have, you can't resist the Patrol Unit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And then? What if the Gendarmerie came? What if the city's garrisons and all the nobles' soldiers came?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We just don't have the firepower. Once we've accumulated enough strength..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because it's not right. It's not right! We can't just look on like this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All these wicked things right before our eyes, but we turn away, just to save ourselves?! That's not right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...That's selfish. Heartless, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If righteousness can only be upheld by greater and greater violence, how can it even be considered righteous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't answer these questions of yours, Talulah. You've studied more than I have, that I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But someone died today in the village. And no more ought to die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're so clever. You can understand that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, go, Talulah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell yourself that, Talulah. Tell yourself that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
